.mp3","items":[{"q":"The first thing is an umbrella.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True"},{"q":"The apples are from England.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True"},{"q":"The apples are from Spain.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False"}]},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Work with your teacher. Point at things and ask What&#x27;s this? / What are these?","sub":"Напиши ответ, затем проверь себя","placeholder":"Твой ответ…","model":"Did you use this / that / these / those?"},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Отметь, чему научился","sub":"Я могу…","items":["✓ point at things (this / that / these / those)","✓ name colours (red, blue, green…)","✓ ask What&#x27;s this? / What are these?","✓ say big / small / new / old","black 🔊 чёрный · қара + Add to My Dictionary","white 🔊 белый · ақ + Add to My Dictionary"]}]}